 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Cast... mais",
   "texto": [
    "**Certes** (certainly) recognizes a point, and **mais** (but) introduces the objection: **Certes, il est riche, mais il est triste** (certainly rich, but sad)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Il est vrai que, je reconnais que",
   "texto": [
    "**Il est vrai que** + sentence (it's true that) and **je reconnais que** (I recognize that) also go with an indication: **Il est vrai que Paul travaille beaucoup** (it's true that Paul works a lot)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Concéder",
   "texto": [
    "**Je te concède ce point** (I grant you that point) introduces a personal concession."
   ]
  },
